<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 21:34:24 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>本·阿弗莱克解释人工智能将如何改变好莱坞</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/ben-affleck-explains-how-ai-will-change-hollywood</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 21:34:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/ben-affleck-explains-how-ai-will-change-hollywood</guid></item><item><title>有史以来最大的自闭症分子图谱为精准治疗开辟了新途径</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/largest-ever-molecular-map-of-autism-opens-new-paths-to-precision-therapies</link><description>二十多年来，研究人员已经发现了数百个增加自闭症谱系障碍（ASD）风险的基因。然而，仍有多个基本问题尚未得到解答：其中，这些基因的突变如何直接导致大脑发育的变化，以及如何将这些知识转化为更有效的疗法？ &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/largest-ever-molecular-map-of-autism-opens-new-paths-to-precision-therapies.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 21:19:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/largest-ever-molecular-map-of-autism-opens-new-paths-to-precision-therapies</guid></item><item><title>首次临床试验中细胞疗法显着减少严重类风湿性关节炎</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/cell-therapy-substantially-reduces-severe-rheumatoid-arthritis-in-first-clinical-trial</link><description>CAR T 细胞疗法等免疫疗法主要用于治疗癌症。未来，这些由患者自身免疫细胞制造的针对患者的疗法也可以帮助治愈自身免疫性疾病。六名患有特别严重的类风湿性关节炎的患者现已在柏林夏里特医学大学接受了这种治疗。在日记中&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/cell-therapy-substantially-reduces-severe-rheumatoid-arthritis-in-first-clinical-trial.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 21:04:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/cell-therapy-substantially-reduces-severe-rheumatoid-arthritis-in-first-clinical-trial</guid></item><item><title>MES 集成差距：93% 拥有它，只有 23% 完成工作</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/mes-integration-gap-93-have-it-only-23-finished-the-job</link><description>MES集成差距：93%的制造商拥有MES集成，只有23%的制造商完全集成。 70 点的差距不是技术问题，而是资金问题。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/mes-integration-gap-93-have-it-only-23-finished-the-job.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 20:49:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/mes-integration-gap-93-have-it-only-23-finished-the-job</guid></item><item><title>人工智能的危险日益令人不安：随着与时间的赛跑开始，盖茨为与习近平的关键一对一定下了基调</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/disquiet-grows-over-ais-dangers-gates-sets-tone-for-pivotal-one-on-one-with-xi-as-a-race-against-time-begins</link><description>人工智能风险：比尔·盖茨计划提出的一项重要建议是对能够设计分子或协助生物攻击的人工智能系统进行国际监控。他认为这种监督可以在不限制合法技术发展的情况下进行。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/disquiet-grows-over-ais-dangers-gates-sets-tone-for-pivotal-one-on-one-with-xi-as-a-race-against-time-begins.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 20:34:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/disquiet-grows-over-ais-dangers-gates-sets-tone-for-pivotal-one-on-one-with-xi-as-a-race-against-time-begins</guid></item><item><title>你真的几岁了？研究解释了“表观遗传时钟”的运作原理，并推出了新的预测工具</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/how-old-are-you-really-study-explains-what-makes-epigenetic-clocks-tick-debuts-new-prediction-tools</link><description>“表观遗传时钟”实际上测量什么？这些实验室测试已成为研究生物衰老或人体细胞功能如何以比预期更快或更慢的速度变化的流行工具。然而，迄今为止，这些测量背后的基本生物学原理在很大程度上仍然未知。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/how-old-are-you-really-study-explains-what-makes-epigenetic-clocks-tick-debuts-new-prediction-tools3.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 20:19:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/how-old-are-you-really-study-explains-what-makes-epigenetic-clocks-tick-debuts-new-prediction-tools</guid></item><item><title>哈佛大学的新研究证实，日常服用维生素可以在四年内延缓衰老过程</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/common-daily-vitamin-shown-to-slow-aging-process-over-4year-period-new-harvard-study-confirms</link><description>哈佛大学的研究发现，每天补充维生素 D 可以通过保护端粒来延缓衰老。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/common-daily-vitamin-shown-to-slow-aging-process-over-4year-period-new-harvard-study-confirms.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 20:04:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/common-daily-vitamin-shown-to-slow-aging-process-over-4year-period-new-harvard-study-confirms</guid></item><item><title>物理学家声称，在现实的最深处，时间和空间并不存在</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/on-the-deepest-level-of-reality-time-and-space-dont-exist-physicist-claims</link><description>根据一项有争议的理论，当时空的组成部分“结晶”形成时，我们的宇宙就出现了。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/on-the-deepest-level-of-reality-time-and-space-dont-exist-physicist-claims2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 19:49:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/on-the-deepest-level-of-reality-time-and-space-dont-exist-physicist-claims</guid></item><item><title>研究表明，你可以欺骗眼睛看到“禁忌”世界，甚至解锁看不见的东西</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/you-can-trick-your-eyes-into-seeing-a-forbidden-worldand-even-unlock-whats-invisible-studies-show</link><description>现在，研究人员终于解开了长达数十年的关于我们视觉的谜团。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/you-can-trick-your-eyes-into-seeing-a-forbidden-worldand-even-unlock-whats-invisible-studies-show.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 19:34:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/you-can-trick-your-eyes-into-seeing-a-forbidden-worldand-even-unlock-whats-invisible-studies-show</guid></item><item><title>亚当·贝克尔 (Adam Becker) 谈“一切都永远”和科技的未来神话</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/adam-becker-on-more-everything-forever-and-techs-future-myths</link><description>&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/adam-becker-on-more-everything-forever-and-techs-future-myths.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 19:19:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/adam-becker-on-more-everything-forever-and-techs-future-myths</guid></item></channel></rss>